								Gnomercy~!!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=345"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15210#msg15210"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15210#msg15210">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2341 on:</b> March 05, 2005, 03:15:33 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Sorry no.&nbsp; Only a few mangina&#039;s in my lifetime that were trully my pleasure to meet.<br /><br />I didn&#039;t like the original, not digging you too much either, so guess you get to reap that.&nbsp; <br /><br />Kara and Killy can attest to my rl weight since that must be an issue?<br /><br />6&#039;4&quot; 240lb gnome!<br /><br /><br />Dread on the past, they are called memories and we can do that.&nbsp; <br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Dwalion SoulVoid &lt;Arirang&gt;<br />70 Necromancer <br /><br />You will more than likely post something stupid and I will respond with something witty.&nbsp; I will more than likely post something stupid and you will respond with something witty.
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg15221"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=345" title="View the profile of Dwalion SoulVoid">Dwalion SoulVoid</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 129<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								Gnomercy~!!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=345"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15221#msg15221"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15221#msg15221">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2342 on:</b> March 05, 2005, 12:41:29 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							/yawn, I just woke up to check the boards cause I am addicted to what some punk says bout meh oh noz.<br /><br />SO in the mean time, I&#039;ll toss up a list that some refer to as posterity.<br /><br /><br />Top 10 Progression (Furthest in Content)<br /><br />1. EiE<br />2. DA<br />3. Conviction<br />4. RoS<br />5. IL<br />6. UoP<br />7. DN<br />8. OA<br />9. BM<br />10.&nbsp; League of Sozobon<br /><br />Okay, wtf is Sozobon, I understand the concept of &quot;League of&quot;, but Sozobon, person place or thing?&nbsp; Someone esplain that shit.&nbsp; <br /><br />Top 10 ALL TIME<br /><br />1.&nbsp; Avatars of Discord<br />2.&nbsp; Ascent<br />3.&nbsp; Echoes in Eternity<br />4.&nbsp; Arirang<br />5.&nbsp; Dol Amroth<br />6.&nbsp; Fires of Time<br />7.&nbsp; Altered Destiny<br />8.&nbsp; Conviction<br />9.&nbsp; Eastern Keep<br />10. Reign of Swords<br /><br />Honorable mention Arcane Legacy, Exiled Legion, Axiom Shift, Circle of Sol, Dragon Force, Dragon Knights, Pirates of Velious, Seekers of Dawn, Harbinger of Storms, Ancient Souls, Union of Power.<br />(Let&#039;s Argue about this!!! !!!)(Except Delheru, he is too dogmatic and insane)<br /><br /><br />Top 5 Quickest Progressing Guilds<br /><br />1.&nbsp; Conviction<br />2.&nbsp; Ascent<br />3.&nbsp; Inner Loop<br />4.&nbsp; Highland Clan<br />5.&nbsp; Avatars of Discord<br /><br /><br />Top 5 Peculiar Guild Names<br /><br />1.&nbsp; Squirrels of Honor<br />2.&nbsp; War Machine of the Tiny<br />3.&nbsp; Heros of Mithril Hall<br />4.&nbsp; League of Sozobon<br />5.&nbsp; Happy Goodtimes Gang<br /><br />Top 10 Influential people on RN (overall, not your buddy)(Good or bad)<br /><br />1.&nbsp; Dyvim - pioneer strats<br />2.&nbsp; Delheru - polished strats<br />3.&nbsp; Honch - commercialized guild leadership<br />4.&nbsp; Carol - redefined tyranny<br />5.&nbsp; Fraglet - ruined a board<br />6.&nbsp; Kinladar - started a board<br />7.&nbsp; Eelyen - forefront of leadership and drama<br />8.&nbsp; Axine - dramatized leadership<br />9.&nbsp; Ghime - innovated the perma grind<br />10.&nbsp; Sazzabi and Bagbok - dueling<br /><br />Top 10 postesr on this board (thought and quality)<br /><br />1.&nbsp; Kinladar<br />2.&nbsp; Callon<br />3.&nbsp; Zerxes<br />4.&nbsp; Redknight<br />5.&nbsp; Delheru<br />6.&nbsp; Eelyen<br />7.&nbsp; VandenRN<br />8.&nbsp; Ssnakess<br />9.&nbsp; Givins<br />10.&nbsp; Tiiden (lawsuit threat baaay beee)<br /><br /><br />Top 5 Top 10/5<br /><br />1.&nbsp; All time<br />2.&nbsp; Progression<br />3.&nbsp; Quickest Progression<br />4.&nbsp; Poster<br />5.&nbsp; Influential player<br /><br />Honorable mention, Peculiar Guild names.<br /><br /><br />Can I have this stickied wiff da HIStory of Rodcet Knife (author Delheru copyrightz authorships)<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Dwalion SoulVoid &lt;Arirang&gt;<br />70 Necromancer <br /><br />You will more than likely post something stupid and I will respond with something witty.&nbsp; I will more than likely post something stupid and you will respond with something witty.
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg15222"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=303" title="View the profile of Soupy Sales">Soupy Sales</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
